"《會稽典錄》曰：昕字大明。少游京師，師事太傅陳蕃，博覽群書，明於風角，善推災異。辟太尉府，舉高第，稍遷丹楊太守。曹公起義兵，昕前後遣兵萬餘人助公征伐。袁術之在淮南也，昕惡其淫虐，絕不與通。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jing:line011-pei03-01:m0008"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu051-t-wu051-jing3:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jing:line011-pei03-01","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jing:line011-pei03-01:m0008","start":51,"end":55,"surface":"丹楊太守","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jing:line011-pei03-02:r0037","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jing:line011-pei03-02","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"我","person_id":"lsy_sjz_pse","referent_role":"speaker_self","quote":"不赦。昕曰：「我則不德，百姓何","note":"依對話說話者、受書者及上下句定位。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-jing","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-jing"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line014","text":"景常隨堅征伐有功，拜騎都尉。袁術上景領丹楊太守，討故太守周昕，遂據其郡。孫策與孫河、呂範依景，合眾共討涇縣山賊祖郎。郎敗走。會為劉繇所迫，景復北依術，術以為督軍中郎將，與孫賁共討樊能、於麋於橫江，又擊笮融、薛禮於秣陵。時策被創牛渚，降賊復反，景攻討，盡禽之。從討劉繇，繇奔豫章，策遣景、賁到壽春報術。術方與劉備爭徐州，以景為為廣陵太守。術後僭號。策以書喻術，術不納，便絕江津，不與通，使人告景。景即委郡東歸，策復以景為丹揚太守。漢遣議郎王誧銜命南行，表景為揚武將軍，領郡如故。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line014:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"景","kind":"person","person_id":"ere_ume_47r","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line014:m0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"堅","kind":"person","person_id":"ki7_rgz_3l4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line014:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"術","kind":"person","person_id":"865_b69_cb0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-wu:line